 doesn't appear to be completely  one-dimensional when he initially  appeared years he actually warns the  humans to get to safety instead of  attacking them he also refuses to follow  lucifero's orders even though we all  assumed that lucifero would be his  Superior and at the end of the battle he  not only passes up on the opportunity to  kill Asta he also Yanks out lucifero's  devil heart and flies away with it so  yeah adramelek seems like an interesting  character and it was clear that he would  return to the story again at some point  in the future but we had no idea just  how interesting he would turn out to be  in the very next chapter the latest  chapter chapter 331 is a sort of  epilogue or PostScript to the Spade  Kingdom War Arc and it leads into the  single biggest twist in the history of  Black Clover we start off with the  reveal that yuno's Mom Ciel grinberry  all is still alive apparently and she  just kind of shows up out of nowhere I  was under the impression that she was  killed back when the sograta siblings  took over but I guess not yuno's mom who  apparently hasn't aged at all in 17  years tells her son that he's become  such a fine young man and she then  proceeds to hug him now I would start  talking about how weird it is that we  are just finding out that she's alive  now since there was plenty of time for  the Spade guys like Ralph to reveal this  information to you know but let's just  move on because there's a lot more to  cover the Spade guys then bow to you  know and ask him to stay inside the  Spade Kingdom and help keep it safe but  yuno replies that he must first keep the  vows that he made to the Clover Kingdom  and to his rival osta elsewhere Asta  thanks liebe for allowing him to see his  mother lichita through liebe's memories  knowing that his mother really did love  him makes Asta happy and then liebe  thinks Asta in turn for helping him  avenge lichita's death this seems to  indicate that lucifero really is gone  for good A 